  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "maxmind_db: Don't spawn mmdbresolve at startup if the preference is off",
  "description": "The very first time maxmind_db_post_update_cb is called is before all\nthe preferences and commandline options have been read. (We load all\nthe UATs then for various reasons.) In that case, wait to start it\nwhen the nameres preferences are applied. Unconditionally indicate\nthat the nameres preferences need to be applied when initializing\nMaxMindDB, so that it is started even if no nameres preferences are\nchanged (since the default is true, it needs to be started in that\ncase.)\n\nFix #20652",
